# every harness reads (see AGENTS.md). Ignoring it silently drops new skills.
.antigravitycli
.claude
.coland
# Local coland task skills — present on disk for the tool, never committed.
.agents/skills/coland*
.kiro

# Working docs — on disk for us, never published.
/domain.md
/ui-issue.md
/rfcs/content_anchored_comments.md
/rfcs/crates.md
/rfcs/editor.md
/rfcs/review_app.md
/crates/app/README.md

